  m_text: "<size=24>- <b>1 Scatter</b> on reel <b>5</b> of each array, <b>2 Scatters</b>
    in total\n  triggers <b>10 Queen\u2019s Bounty Free Games</b>.\n\n- During Free
    Games, Wild can appear anywhere \n  on reels for both arrays.\n\n- During <b>Free
    Games</b>, <b>Wild Copy Feature</b>\n  works in both directions.\n\n- No re-trigger
    is allowed."
